'''Captain Rimor''' is a high ranking officer of the [[Shayzien Army]], found at the entrance of the [[Chambers of Xeric]], warning the player about the dangers within.

Players who complete certain amounts of the Chambers of Xeric in [[Chambers of Xeric/Challenge Mode|Challenge Mode]] may speak to Captain Rimor to receive a cape:

